ppery Rock","notes":"Plan around Homecoming weekend and watch the annual parade route through town; SRU’s 2025 announcement identifies it as a Homecoming tradition.","short_summary":"A recurring Homecoming parade connecting campus and town.","evidence_claim":"SRU News calls the annual parade part of SRU’s Homecoming tradition and states that its 2025 route began on Main Street.","source_url":"https://news.sru.edu/news/sru-hosting-2025-homecoming-events-oct-16-18/","source_title":"SRU hosting 2025 Homecoming events, Oct. 16-18","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-10-07","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Check SRU’s current Homecoming schedule and local traffic guidance before attending.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sru-homecoming-pep-rally","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"SRU Homecoming Pep Rally","title":"Catch the Homecoming pep rally","subtitle":"The Quad, Slippery Rock University","notes":"Look for the Homecoming pep rally schedule and attend the public spirit program, which features SRU performance groups and the coaches’ speech.","short_summary":"A recurring Homecoming gathering for performances and school spirit.","evidence_claim":"SRU News lists the Homecoming pep rally among the 2025 festivities, including performances by the Marching Pride and cheerleaders plus the annual coaches’ speech.","source_url":"https://news.sru.edu/news/sru-hosting-2025-homecoming-events-oct-16-18/","source_title":"SRU hosting 2025 Homecoming events, Oct. 16-18","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-10-07","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Event timing and location can change annually; consult the current Homecoming program.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"sru-homecoming-royalty","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"SRU Homecoming Royalty","title":"See Homecoming Royalty recognized","subtitle":"Homecoming football halftime, Mihalik-Thompson Stadium","notes":"At the Homecoming game, watch for recognition of the Homecoming Royalty. SRU adopted the gender-inclusive “royalty” title beginning in 2018.","short_summary":"A halftime Homecoming recognition with inclusive terminology.","evidence_claim":"SRU states that beginning in 2018 it replaced king and queen titles with gender-inclusive “homecoming royalty,” while retaining the time-honored Homecoming court introduction.","source_url":"https://www.sru.edu/news/092618b","source_title":"SRU introduces gender inclusive homecoming royalty","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2018-09-26","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Presented during Homecoming football halftime; game admission and current event details apply.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["Some traditions are documented in archival or historical reporting; check SRU’s current events calendar for annual Homecoming details."]}],"warnings":[]}
